depth":3,"id":"options","children":[{"type":"text","value":"options"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TranscriptionActivityOptions"},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TAdapter"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TStream"},{"type":"text","value":">"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"returns","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TranscriptionActivityResult"},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TStream"},{"type":"text","value":">"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"examples","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Examples"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Transcribe an audio file"}]}]},{"type":"code","value":"import { generateTranscription } from '@tanstack/ai'\nimport { openaiTranscription } from '@tanstack/ai-openai'\n\nconst result = await generateTranscription({\n  adapter: openaiTranscription('whisper-1'),\n  audio: audioFile, // File, Blob, or base64 string\n  language: 'en'\n})\n\nconsole.log(result.text)","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"With verbose output for timestamps"}]}]},{"type":"code","value":"const result = await generateTranscription({\n  adapter: openaiTranscription('whisper-1'),\n  audio: audioFile,\n  responseFormat: 'verbose_json'\n})\n\nresult.segments?.forEach(segment => {\n  console.log(`[${segment.start}s - ${segment.end}s]: ${segment.text}`)\n})","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Streaming transcription result"}]}]},{"type":"code","value":"for await (const chunk of generateTranscription({\n  adapter: openaiTranscription('whisper-1'),\n  audio: audioFile,\n  stream: true\n})) {\n  console.log(chunk)\n}","lang":"ts"}],"headings":[{"id":"type-parameters","text":"Type Parameters","level":2},{"id":"tadapter","text":"TAdapter","level":3},{"id":"tstream","text":"TStream","level":3},{"id":"parameters","text":"Parameters","level":2},{"id":"options","text":"options","level":3},{"id":"returns","text":"Returns","level":2},{"id":"examples","text":"Examples","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\nfunction generateTranscription<TAdapter, TStream>(options): TranscriptionActivityResult<TStream>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/activities/generateTranscription/index.ts:189](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/generateTranscription/index.ts#L189)\n\nTranscription activity - converts audio to text.\n\nUses AI speech-to-text models to transcribe audio content.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TAdapter\n\n`TAdapter` *extends* [`TranscriptionAdapter`](../interfaces/TranscriptionAdapter.md)\\<`string`, `TranscriptionProviderOptions`\\<`TAdapter`\\>\\>\n\n### TStream\n\n`TStream` *extends* `boolean` = `false`\n\n## Parameters\n\n### options\n\n`TranscriptionActivityOptions`\\<`TAdapter`, `TStream`\\>\n\n## Returns\n\n`TranscriptionActivityResult`\\<`TStream`\\>\n\n## Examples\n\n**Transcribe an audio file**\n\n```ts\nimport { generateTranscription } from '@tanstack/ai'\nimport { openaiTranscription } from '@tanstack/ai-openai'\n\nconst result = await generateTranscription({\n  adapter: openaiTranscription('whisper-1'),\n  audio: audioFile, // File, Blob, or base64 string\n  language: 'en'\n})\n\nconsole.log(result.text)\n```\n\n**With verbose output for timestamps**\n\n```ts\nconst result = await generateTranscription({\n  adapter: openaiTranscription('whisper-1'),\n  audio: audioFile,\n  responseFormat: 'verbose_json'\n})\n\nresult.segments?.forEach(segment => {\n  console.log(`[${segment.start}s - ${segment.end}s]: ${segment.text}`)\n})\n```\n\n**Streaming transcription result**\n\n```ts\nfor await (const chunk of generateTranscription({\n  adapter: openaiTranscription('whisper-1'),\n  audio: audioFile,\n  stream: true\n})) {\n  console.log(chunk)\n}\n```\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: generateTranscription\ntitle: generateTranscription\n---\n\n```ts\nfunction generateTranscription<TAdapter, TStream>(options): TranscriptionActivityResult<TStream>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/activities/generateTranscription/index.ts:189](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/generateTranscription/index.ts#L189)\n\nTranscription activity - converts audio to text.\n\nUses AI speech-to-text models to transcribe audio content.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TAdapter\n\n`TAdapter` *extends* [`TranscriptionAdapter`](../interfaces/TranscriptionAdapter.md)\\<`string`, `TranscriptionProviderOptions`\\<`TAdapter`\\>\\>\n\n### TStream\n\n`TStream` *extends* `boolean` = `false`\n\n## Parameters\n\n### options\n\n`TranscriptionActivityOptions`\\<`TAdapter`, `TStream`\\>\n\n## Returns\n\n`TranscriptionActivityResult`\\<`TStream`\\>\n\n## Examples\n\n**Transcribe an audio file**\n\n```ts\nimport { generateTranscription } from '@tanstack/ai'\nimport { openaiTranscription } from '@tanstack/ai-openai'\n\nconst result = await generateTranscription({\n  adapter: openaiTranscription('whisper-1'),\n  audio: audioFile, // File, Blob, or base64 string\n  language: 'en'\n})\n\nconsole.log(result.text)\n```\n\n**With verbose output for timestamps**\n\n```ts\nconst result = await generateTranscription({\n  adapter: openaiTranscription('whisper-1'),\n  audio: audioFile,\n  responseFormat: 'verbose_json'\n})\n\nresult.segments?.forEach(segment => {\n  console.log(`[${segment.start}s - ${segment.end}s]: ${segment.text}`)\n})\n```\n\n**Streaming transcription result**\n\n```ts\nfor await (const chunk of generateTranscription({\n  adapter: openaiTranscription('whisper-1'),\n  audio: audioFile,\n  stream: true\n})) {\n  console.log(chunk)\n}\n```\n"}
